01291936789025", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12331303_245598725994458_479181173273133056_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OF9GY1TDSpoQ7kNvwHJev5D&_nc_oc=AdqthE8ZHM_p4E0xTpAN7kt1NgYnhDe6DulsrPdP8b2Ozp6rEQ67R-Gj2TJr3tZ9LVg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGmV1EM3nhuHsaBZfVbAh13-bQ_nuu9wanpZCWrutebig&oe=6A8050BD"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "642658059801509", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12139433_425044671239926_4609888145117282304_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gIP4qwtlFdwQ7kNvwGcRCfI&_nc_oc=AdrN_1SgJgr0VgMYmIYC7fR30djTgHF1deArj9uha1-XfB8SIeEpVS26MOux1xEhcl4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQE4DhQGQV3uOncqImRHmajmmAVN9VA4N7UC6zsnp97cnA&oe=6A806F3B"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "619740281913536", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12139467_430682997415049_6349888944162734080_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cJVCiugTqC0Q7kNvwHj8mE_&_nc_oc=Adqn0KqbqiyLs7eAvP2GR1_lSimQtv7uv_3XxdE9e1g7t3jhQHZOD7X_KtW7XYKxLfI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQE14XwGsB492IkqnxxavU2bA9JDUbMGEqA8TUpMX7va8Q&oe=6A804C25"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "RotatorX", "keywords": ["Arcade", "Endlessrunner", "SciFi", "Speed", "Fast"], "long_description": "RotatorX is an endless runner type arcade game with a dark unique sci-fi atmosphere. Fast paced and addictive - but also meditative. The intuitive controls makes it easy to play - but it's hard to gain. Speed, procedural level design, dynamic lighting FX and an adaptive soundtrack will guarantee a challenging and immersive VR experience.\n\nKEY FEATURES\n* Dynamic lighting FX\n* Adaptive soundtrack\n* Intuitve controls\n* Procedural level design\n\n! Oculus Go only !", "short_description": "RotatorX is an endless runner type arcade game with a